  "overview": "Airtable's website is a clean, enterprise-friendly platform that communicates \"sophisticated simplicity\" through a white canvas with deep navy text (#181d26) and Airtable Blue (#1b61c9) as the primary interactive accent. The Haas font family (display + text variants) creates a Swiss-precision typography system with positive letter-spacing throughout.\n\nKey Characteristics:\n- White canvas with deep navy text (#181d26)\n- Airtable Blue (#1b61c9) as primary CTA and link color\n- Haas + Haas Groot Disp dual font system\n- Positive letter-spacing on body text (0.08px–0.28px)\n- 12px radius buttons, 16px–32px for cards\n- Multi-layer blue-tinted shadow: rgba(45,127,249,0.28) 0px 1px 3px\n- Semantic theme tokens: --theme_* CSS variable naming",
  "dos": "Do: Use Airtable Blue for CTAs, Haas with positive tracking, 12px radius buttons\nDon't: Skip positive letter-spacing, use heavy shadows"
